\pard\b\fs20 Coral Skies\b0\par
\fs16\par
The blimp was a great idea! Finally independent of the sea. But what now? You are heading for flying sky islands! On closer inspection you see that they are overgrown with corals. Your explorer's zeal finally makes you land on the sky islands. What secret might the floating coral islands hold?\par
\par
The goal is to mine all the corals.\par
